  "description": "Rear Dormer and 3m Single Storey rear Extension",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;table cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; hspace=&quot;0&quot; vspace=&quot;0&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;\r\n &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;\r\n  &lt;td valign=&quot;top&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding-top:0cm;padding-right:2.25pt;\r\n  padding-bottom:0cm;padding-left:2.25pt&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor rear\r\n  extension would result in an inappropriate roof form that would\r\n  intersect the proposed rear dormer creating a development considered to be\r\n  an unduly obtrusive and incongruous addition to the original\r\n  dwellinghouse resulting in cumulative overdevelopment of the site,\r\n  failing to respect the character and proportions of the dwellinghouse\r\n  and the visual amenities of the locality. The proposal would therefore be\r\n  contrary to the high quality design aspiration of the National Planning\r\n  Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 of The London Plan (2021), Policies GR1of\r\n  the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the relevant provisions of the adopted\r\n  Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/td&gt;\r\n &lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
